{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy and a girl,\u00a0 and a story about defeating loneliness in a mysterious forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peach Tangle is a visual\u00a0novel\u00a0with fully animated\u00a0scenes,\u00a0including all the\u00a0sex\u00a0scenes! Get\u00a0to\u00a0know a cute girl with a unique personality and explore a beautifully rendered forest full of secrets, in this short, gripping story! A story full of drama, comedy and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/extras/17471cf38400d25d99e56ace446c31e6.avif?t=1751408622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/extras_big/17471cf38400d25d99e56ace446c31e6.avif?t=1751408622 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wendel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loner,\u00a0half\u00a0by\u00a0choice, half\u00a0by\u00a0necessity.\u00a0\u00a0Fundamentally\u00a0a\u00a0good\u00a0guy,\u00a0he's very\u00a0pleasant\u00a0if\u00a0you\u00a0take\u00a0the\u00a0effort\u00a0to get\u00a0to\u00a0know\u00a0him. The\u00a0problem\u00a0is\u00a0he rarely\u00a0makes\u00a0that\u00a0effort\u00a0himself,\u00a0and other people don't\u00a0really\u00a0have\u00a0a\u00a0reason\u00a0to either.\u00a0So all his\u00a0life\u00a0he's\u00a0had\u00a0very\u00a0few\u00a0close\u00a0friends\u00a0and\u00a0even\u00a0fewer girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/extras/d27570a8c3bc4fdd5e80645eb3a0ad3d.avif?t=1751408622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/extras_big/d27570a8c3bc4fdd5e80645eb3a0ad3d.avif?t=1751408622 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mira</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong-willed\u00a0girl. She doesn't see it herself, but people often call her a tomboy. She's\u00a0always\u00a0looking\u00a0out\u00a0for\u00a0other\u00a0people,\u00a0even if it\u00a0means\u00a0a\u00a0bunch\u00a0of\u00a0extra\u00a0work\u00a0for\u00a0herself.\u00a0Despite hardships,\u00a0she\u00a0does\u00a0her\u00a0best to\u00a0stay\u00a0cheerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 Hours of reading time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD 1080P - Enjoy the game with HD graphics and illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated sex scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14+ fantastic music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything crafted lovingly by human hands, no AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D characters &amp; BGs mixed with 2D hand painted artworks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like the game hit me up on Patreon to help me make more games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(AhaNubis @ Patreon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/extras/56ba3307630120a5af1e3d23aa442f29.avif?t=1751408622\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792360?t=1751408622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792360?t=1751408622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/e5b3365da4aabbe21c4d0e9fd3a48974174dfad5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751408622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792360/e5b3365da4aabbe21c4d0e9fd3a48974174dfad5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751408622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full contro